WEBVTT

00:00:24.083 --> 00:00:26.083
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:01:04.125 --> 00:01:06.125
[♪ pleasant music playing]

00:01:46.166 --> 00:01:48.166
[♪ thrilling music playing]

00:02:41.041 --> 00:02:43.041
[♪ thrilling music continues]

00:03:33.416 --> 00:03:35.416
[♪ melancholic music playing]

00:03:58.125 --> 00:04:00.125
[♪ captivating music playing]

00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:54.833
[♪ enchanting music playing]

00:05:37.625 --> 00:05:40.291
Okay, Deep Dark Secret.

00:05:40.458 --> 00:05:41.458
It's time.

00:05:41.541 --> 00:05:42.875
[groans]

00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:46.458
It's okay. Come on.

00:05:46.541 --> 00:05:47.833
[mumbling]

00:05:48.666 --> 00:05:51.041
Okay. Let it go, buddy.

00:05:51.208 --> 00:05:52.458
What's the secret?

00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:54.625
[sighs wearily]

00:05:54.708 --> 00:05:57.583
We burn hole in rug.

00:05:57.875 --> 00:05:59.750
Really? That's it? Whew!

00:05:59.916 --> 00:06:02.333
I thought you were gonna say
the time we peed in the pool.

00:06:02.416 --> 00:06:04.541
-[whimpers]
-Oh, no, wait.

00:06:06.541 --> 00:06:07.750
And he's gone.

